# [[.Name]]

A kakarot service. Layers, outside in:

| Package     | Layer                                            | Written by |
|-------------|--------------------------------------------------|------------|
| transport/  | HTTP routes (`http_gen.go`)                      | kakarot gen |
| endpoint/   | typed endpoints (`endpoints_gen.go`)             | kakarot gen |
| service/    | the API; annotate it with `//kakarot:` comments  | you |
| usecase/    | business rules, ports (repository interfaces)    | you |
| domain/     | DTOs and validation                              | you |
| data/       | storm repositories; `data/model` are DB types    | you + storm generate |

After changing `service/service.go` or `data/model`, run `go generate ./...`.

```console
$ go test ./...            # usecase and HTTP tests run with no database
$ go tool kakarot check    # layer rules, //kakarot: comments, generated code is current
```

`AGENTS.md` has the rules of the project and the steps to add an operation, for people and coding agents.
